{"unit_id":"xinjiguaike__dsh-session-location#card-zh","repo":"xinjiguaike/dsh-session-location","commit":"93e2456d70875fa498f2bc6a8eb6be0fc1a679cf","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-location 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的会话列表插件，会在单列表模式的会话标题下显示所属工作区和当前 Git 分支。它通过会话行的 leading、trailing 装饰位补齐不同运行状态下的显示，并在通用设置中提供本地开关。工作区名称优先使用工作区标题，缺失时回退到工作目录名；分支信息从普通 Git 检出或 linked worktree 的 HEAD 读取，读取失败时仍保留工作区标签。分支结果按目录短暂缓存，适合需要在多个项目和分支间辨认会话的用户。需要兼容的 DSH 版本，不需额外 API 密钥或账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:231-275","client.js:384-419","package.json:19-29"]}
{"unit_id":"xinjiguaike__dsh-session-location#card-en","repo":"xinjiguaike/dsh-session-location","commit":"93e2456d70875fa498f2bc6a8eb6be0fc1a679cf","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-location shows workspace names and Git branches under session titles in DSH's flat web list. Missing workspace titles fall back to directory names; branch lookup supports regular checkouts and linked worktrees. Requires compatible DSH; no extra key or account.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:170-202","client.js:231-275","client.js:384-419","package.json:19-29"]}
