{"unit_id":"xinjiguaike__dsh-session-location#feature-1","repo":"xinjiguaike/dsh-session-location","commit":"93e2456d70875fa498f2bc6a8eb6be0fc1a679cf","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-location 的功能「会话位置标签」：在单列表会话行标题下展示工作区名和可读取到的 Git 分支。行状态决定使用 leading 或 trailing 装饰位。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:231-275","client.js:384-416"]}
{"unit_id":"xinjiguaike__dsh-session-location#feature-2","repo":"xinjiguaike/dsh-session-location","commit":"93e2456d70875fa498f2bc6a8eb6be0fc1a679cf","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-location 的功能「工作区名称回退」：优先显示会话所属工作区的标题；没有匹配标题时显示工作目录名，无工作目录则显示本地化的未分组标签。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:245-260"]}
{"unit_id":"xinjiguaike__dsh-session-location#feature-3","repo":"xinjiguaike/dsh-session-location","commit":"93e2456d70875fa498f2bc6a8eb6be0fc1a679cf","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-location 的功能「Git 分支读取」：从工作目录的 .git/HEAD 解析普通检出的分支，也处理 linked worktree 的 gitdir 指针；失败时不显示分支。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:170-202"]}
{"unit_id":"xinjiguaike__dsh-session-location#feature-4","repo":"xinjiguaike/dsh-session-location","commit":"93e2456d70875fa498f2bc6a8eb6be0fc1a679cf","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-location 的功能「显示偏好开关」：通用设置中提供开关，控制会话位置标签是否出现。偏好保存在当前浏览器的 localStorage，无法使用时使用内存状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:19-51","client.js:352-380","client.js:397-402"]}
